  "fullDescription": "This palette was inspired by the delicate beauty of hydrangea flowers 🌸. Their petals—ranging from soft sky blue to deep violet and lush green—carry the calm harmony of nature and the freshness of early morning.\n\nI wanted to capture this feeling in a palette of 30 carefully selected colors. It reflects the beauty of gardens after the rain, the gentle glow of summer light, and the timeless elegance of nature.\n\nWhat’s included:\n✔ 30 Procreate swatches (.swatches)\n✔ PNG and JPEG files for universal use\n\n✨ Perfect for designers, illustrators, and creatives who want to simplify color selection and add elegance and depth to their projects.\n\nHow to use:\n\nDownload the files after purchase.\n\nImport the .swatches file into Procreate (Palettes).\n\nUse PNG or JPEG as a reference in Photoshop, Illustrator, or Canva.\n\nStart creating with the natural harmony of hydrangea-inspired tones.",
